SET web:page:about <html><body>About us — a tiny rendered page snippet.</body></html>
SET web:page:pricing <html><body>Pricing — plans, FAQs, and a small comparison table.</body></html>
SET web:page:docs <html><body>Docs landing page.</body></html>
SET web:page:blog <html><body>Latest blog posts (paginated).</body></html>
SET web:page:hero <html><head><title>Welcome</title></head><body><h1>Welcome to the platform</h1><section>Massive hero block with a lot of inline content used to demonstrate a hot, oversized cache value. This blob intentionally repeats a paragraph many times to push memory usage. Each agent that GETs this key pulls the whole thing across the wire and into the client's memory. In a real production cache, this is the kind of hot+big key that drives p99 latency up — both the network round-trip and the deserialization on the client. The fix is usually to either shard the payload (per-section caches) or push the rendering downstream to a CDN. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again. Same paragraph again.</section></body></html>
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:hero
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:hero
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:hero
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:hero
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:hero
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:hero
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:hero
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:hero
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:hero
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:hero
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:pricing
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:pricing
INCR web:counters:hits:web:page:about
LPUSH web:queue:emails {"to":"a@example.com","subject":"Welcome"}
LPUSH web:queue:emails {"to":"b@example.com","subject":"Welcome"}
LPUSH web:queue:emails {"to":"c@example.com","subject":"Welcome"}
SADD web:online:users u1 u2 u3 u4 u5
